  "asset-register": "Every rate this server quotes is a file inside the package rather than a call to a tax authority, so the hosted route runs a depreciation schedule with no network access of its own and returns the same figures as a local install, down to the minor unit. The register itself lives in the hosted store behind the token, so the ten free assets and their ASSET-YYYY-NNNN ids follow the key rather than the machine, and asset_journal hands back expense_add arguments as text, which is exactly what the expense-tracker connector on the same token takes.",
